<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Greencore H1 pretax profit falls 15 percent.</title>
<headline>Greencore H1 pretax profit falls 15 percent.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 28</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.4		    vs 11.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.6		    vs 2.3</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    21.71		  vs 25.52</p>
<p> Turnover		   216.17		 vs 230.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Irish agribusiness firm Greencore Group Plc said profit for the year before exceptional items would be &quot;somehat lower&quot; than last year. Its interim results were hit by an exceptional charge of 5.8 million punts, which resulted from a European Commission fine of seven million punts offset by a profit of 1.2 million on the sale of two non-core businesses.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom +353 1 661 3377</p>
